GAL20V8
DEC20

A    B    C    S    R    EN   NC   NC   NC   NC   NC   GND
NC   NC   NC   Q    Y0   Y1   Y2   Y3   NC   OUT  NC   VCC

Q.T = S + Q * /R
Q.E = VCC

/Y0.T = /A * /B * C
Y0.E = VCC
/Y1.T = A * /B * C
Y1.E = VCC
/Y2.T = /A * B * C
Y2.E = VCC
/Y3.T = A * B * C * Q
Y3.E = VCC

OUT.T = A * B
OUT.E = EN

DESCRIPTION

galre selftest example (GAL20V8 complex mode): active-low decoder, Y3 gated by the set/reset latch Q, OUT with an
output enable. Pins 7-11, 13-15, 21, 23 unconnected.
